en.explanation:
Anas ibn Mālik (may Allah be pleased with him) was asked how the Prophet (ﷺ) used to recite the Qur’an. He said: He would prolong his voice in recitation with Madd (elongation);
he would extend the lām before the hā’ in the word Allāh,
extend the mīm before the nūn in Ar-Rahmān, and extend the hā’ in Ar-Rahīm.
